    "## 2. Simulate\n",
    "\n",
    "Each block's result is drawn from a normal distribution. Paths are built with a cumulative sum, and once a path hits $0 it stays at $0 (the player is broke). The whole simulation is vectorized in NumPy: 10,000 paths x 100 blocks = 1,000,000 draws in a fraction of a second, with no Python loops."
   ]
  },
  {
